  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the molcajete over medium heat.",
    "Heat the olive oil and cook the onion until translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic, cumin, coriander, paprika, salt, and black pepper. Cook for another minute.",
    "Add the romano peppers, chicken broth, and flour. Bring to a simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and let the tagine cook for 20 minutes, or until the peppers are tender.",
    "Stir in the bonito flakes and lemon juice. Cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional bonito flakes if desired.",
    "Remove the molcajete from the heat and let it cool slightly before serving the tagine.",
    "Serve the tagine with a side of rice, flatbread, or vegetables, if desired.",
    "Garnish with additional lemon wedges, if desired."
  ],
